<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Nov 15, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Nov 15   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,772   1,910   2,084</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 7	 7     776</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 1,800   1,938   2,894</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR</p>
<p>Deliverable				 6,062   7,673  10,017</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     389     459   2,742</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     41	41   1,029</p>
<p>Total					 6,492   8,173  13,788</p>
<p>Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing. (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
